Now, should we add a "capture" visual effect / flag change at the farm when taken? The objective marker changes color, but there's no flag. A nice polish: when the farm is taken, raise a French tricolor over the farm or at the objective center. We could draw a flag on the objective marker using the existing flag drawing? Simpler: draw a small French flag at farmZone center in drawObjective when taken, or a gold eagle icon. This would give visual feedback. Current objective title changes to "Break the Allied centre" and marker color gold, messages. But a flag is nice.

