```
But farm center is inside the courtyard, and units walk over. The flag drawn before units will be under them; that's fine. Could raise it above the farm roof at world y -? The farmZone center is around (1435,842), the building spans above; a flag there might be hidden by units but visible. Good.

Alternatively draw an "eagle" gold diamond already. We added a center diamond. A flag would be more thematic. Let's add. Also maybe when not taken, a small Union Jack? Could be too much. Only French flag when captured.

